[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238577\">7005C44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238607\">7005E38</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238604\">7005E12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238605\">7005E22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238517\">5570T90</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238603\">7005E11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238558\">7005A04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238599\">7005D30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238596\">7005D24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238589\">7005D15</a></p><p>1. Extract the retaining pin.</p><p>2. Remove the window fastening element.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018968.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Use a new fastening element.</p><p>Fit the fastening element and insert the\nretaining pin.</p><p>The retaining pin should be fully fitted so that it is flush with\nthe surface of the fixing element.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238589\">7005D15</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238596\">7005D24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238599\">7005D30</a></p><p>Check that the window works properly.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238558\">7005A04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238603\">7005E11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238517\">5570T90</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238605\">7005E22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238604\">7005E12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238607\">7005E38</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238577\">7005C44</a></p>"]]